Evening analysis on 6.24
Target $BTC 61294.9 has effectively broken below the lower Bollinger Band, and the market has entered a temporarily oversold zone, with expectations for a technical bounce in the short term;
 The three Bollinger Bands are all turning down simultaneously, the downward channel is fully open, leading to a mid-term shift towards bearishness;
​The original support level of 61536 has completed the long-short conversion and is now the first strong resistance level for short-term bounces. Currently, it's not suitable to chase the pump; I personally suggest targeting around 60000-60800, with a goal of 61800-62500 near #BTC #ETH #BTC走势分析
